---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import AmazonButton from '../../components/AmazonButton.astro';
import PlannerCTA from '../../components/PlannerCTA.astro';

const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is Dynamic Saunas a good brand?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Dynamic is worth comparing when you want a finished indoor infrared cabin and its exact dimensions, electrical requirements, delivery path, and documentation fit your project. Evaluate the model number and revision rather than relying on a brand-wide ranking."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the difference between Dynamic Saunas model lines?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The current catalog separates low-EMF far-infrared, ultra-low-EMF far-infrared, and full-spectrum models. Capacity, dimensions, emitter count and type, electrical requirements, shipping weight, and included features still vary by exact model."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does a Dynamic infrared sauna provide traditional sauna steam?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. Dynamic's infrared cabins use emitters rather than a traditional heater and stone basket, so they do not provide water-on-stones steam."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---
<Base
  title="Dynamic Saunas Review (2026): Compare Current Model Lines"
  description="Compare Dynamic's current low-EMF, ultra-low-EMF, and full-spectrum infrared sauna lines by model number, dimensions, electrical needs, documentation, and buyer fit."
  canonical="/brands/dynamic-saunas-review"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />

  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700 mb-3">Brand research</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3">Dynamic Saunas: compare the model, not the brand label</h1>
    <p class="text-stone-500 mb-8">Reviewed August 15, 2026 &mdash; Backyard Sauna Pro</p>

    <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-3">
      <img src="/images/editorial/indoor-infrared-sauna-representative.webp" alt="Representative finished indoor infrared sauna cabin" class="w-full object-cover max-h-80" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024" />
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-8">Representative infrared cabin; not a specific Dynamic model.</p>

    <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-8 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <strong>Affiliate disclosure:</strong> As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. This page contains affiliate links.
    </div>

    <div class="bg-stone-100 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-8 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <strong>Research scope:</strong> This is a desk-researched brand guide, not a hands-on test. We reviewed the current Dynamic Saunas Direct catalog and model pages. We have not assembled or measured these cabins, tested their emitters, or independently verified EMF or light-therapy marketing labels.
    </div>

    <p class="text-lg text-stone-700 mb-4">Dynamic sells finished indoor infrared cabins across several model lines. That makes the brand useful to compare, but a brand-wide verdict will not tell you whether a particular cabin fits two adults, reaches the final room, works with the available circuit, or includes the technical documentation you care about.</p>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-8">Start with the heat format and model number. Then compare the cabin's published interior, service requirements, shipping weight, emitter specification, warranty, and current revision.</p>

    <section class="bg-stone-900 text-white rounded-xl p-6 mb-10" aria-labelledby="dynamic-current-path">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-300 mb-2">Current available path</p>
      <h2 id="dynamic-current-path" class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Barcelona DYN-6106-01</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-300 mb-4">The Barcelona is the model we have researched in depth. Its exact Amazon listing was available when checked on August 15, 2026. Read the buyer checklist before treating the 1-2 person capacity label as proof of comfortable two-adult fit.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <AmazonButton asin="B00A2F99F0" variant="primary" ctaPosition="brand_intro" />
        <a href="/reviews/dynamic-saunas-barcelona-review/" class="inline-block border border-stone-500 hover:border-stone-300 text-white font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm">Read the Barcelona buyer checklist</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Current model lines</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-5">Dynamic's current catalog groups products by emitter and EMF marketing category. Those labels are a starting point, not a substitute for model-specific technical data.</p>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-stone-200 rounded-lg mb-10">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[680px] text-sm text-left">
        <thead class="bg-stone-100 text-stone-900">
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Line</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Catalog distinction</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">What to verify</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-stone-200 text-stone-700">
          <tr class="align-top">
            <th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900">Low-EMF far infrared</th>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">The baseline far-infrared line, including current Barcelona and Avila variants.</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">Model number, seated-position EMF documentation, interior fit, circuit, and revision.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="align-top">
            <th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900">Ultra-low-EMF far infrared</th>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">Elite variants with different emitter labeling in the current catalog.</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">Exact numerical measurements, method, distance, frequency range, and model coverage.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="align-top">
            <th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900">Full spectrum</th>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">Models marketed with more than far-infrared output.</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">Emitter locations, wavelength documentation, controls, electrical service, and intended use.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <PlannerCTA
      source="dynamic_brand_compare"
      heading="Check the room and circuit before choosing a Dynamic model"
      description="Record the interior fit, delivery route, circuit, ventilation, budget, and heat-format preference before comparing checkout prices."
    />

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Six model-level checks</h2>
    <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-4 text-stone-700 mb-10">
      <li><strong>Interior dimensions:</strong> mark the published interior footprint, then assess the intended users rather than trusting a capacity label.</li>
      <li><strong>Electrical service:</strong> verify voltage, amperage, dedicated-circuit language, plug, outlet location, and extension-cord restrictions in the current manual.</li>
      <li><strong>Delivery path:</strong> compare box and panel dimensions with doors, stairs, corners, elevators, and the final assembly area.</li>
      <li><strong>Emitter documentation:</strong> identify the emitter type and count. Request model-specific EMF or spectrum data if those labels affect the decision.</li>
      <li><strong>Feature specifications:</strong> treat colored cabin lighting as lighting unless wavelength, irradiance, distance, and dose are documented.</li>
      <li><strong>Seller and revision:</strong> confirm the model number, revision, included parts, warranty contact, return terms, and freight-damage process.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Barcelona versus Avila</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-4">The current baseline Barcelona and Avila pages both publish a 39-by-36-by-73-inch exterior, a 36-by-32-by-67-inch interior, natural hemlock construction, and 120V/15A service. The product pages list different model numbers and emitter counts: DYN-6106-01 with six panels for Barcelona, and DYN-6103-01 with seven panels for Avila.</p>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-8">That does not establish which feels better or performs better. Compare the exact panel layout, current manual, price, seller, and included revision. For the Barcelona, our detailed review separates published facts from claims that still need documentation.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">When another format fits better</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-10">
      <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl p-5">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-900 mb-3">Keep Dynamic on the shortlist when</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700">
          <li>You want a finished indoor infrared cabin.</li>
          <li>The published interior works for the intended users.</li>
          <li>The exact circuit and location meet the current manual.</li>
          <li>You have a workable freight and assembly plan.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-stone-100 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-5">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3">Compare another format when</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700">
          <li>You want a traditional heater, stones, and water-on-stones steam.</li>
          <li>The cabin is too tight or cannot reach the final room.</li>
          <li>The available circuit does not match the selected model.</li>
          <li>Required technical claims remain undocumented.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Primary sources checked</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-stone-700 mb-10">
      <li><a href="https://dynamicsaunasdirect.com/collections/all-saunas" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Dynamic Saunas Direct: current sauna catalog</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://dynamicsaunasdirect.com/products/barcelona-1-2-person-low-emf-far-infrared-sauna" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Dynamic: Barcelona DYN-6106-01</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://dynamicsaunasdirect.com/products/new-2023-model-avila-1-2-person-low-emf-far-infrared-sauna" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Dynamic: Avila DYN-6103-01</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://dynamicsaunasdirect.com/collections/dynamic-ultra-low-emf-far-infrared-sauna" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Dynamic: ultra-low-EMF catalog</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://dynamicsaunasdirect.com/collections/dynamic-full-spectrum-saunas" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Dynamic: full-spectrum catalog</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">FAQ</h2>
    <div class="space-y-5">
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">Is Dynamic Saunas a good brand?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">It is worth comparing for a finished indoor infrared cabin. The exact model, room, circuit, documentation, delivery, and seller should decide the purchase.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">What is the difference between Dynamic model lines?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">The current catalog separates low-EMF far-infrared, ultra-low-EMF far-infrared, and full-spectrum models. Specifications still vary by exact model and revision.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">Does a Dynamic cabin provide traditional sauna steam?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">No. It uses infrared emitters rather than a traditional heater and stone basket.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-6 mt-10">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Related buyer guides</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/reviews/dynamic-saunas-barcelona-review/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Dynamic Barcelona Buyer Checklist</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/infrared-vs-traditional-sauna/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Infrared vs Traditional Sauna</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/best-indoor-sauna-kits/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Indoor Sauna Formats</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/sauna-electrical-requirements/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Sauna Electrical Planning</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
